    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>星盘信息及图片信息来自网络，</span></p><span></span><p><span>因时间关系只能说是浅读，</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目只是一个视角，</span></p><span></span><p><span>要不要离婚不是最终答案，</span></p><span></span><p><span>找到自己婚姻中的相处模式才更有意义。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目对占星小白信息量有点大，</span></p><span></span><p><span>对有些基础的听友可能会有意想不到的收获，</span></p><span></span><p><span>星盘贴在下面，</span></p><span></span><p><span>方便大家对照。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmhBnwVz0lHZQC1hgt45aNeiPTxI.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlIcnrdXFjDYR7Zz7ZIjPYGMG6A9.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo5Gx4svud07fAZn6i8kRsPRncG_.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh1zNqGQo9UHtNrhOHja45PXW8lp.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flm0EF-ynxSTz36jsM0FHhEW2mRj.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>⌛⌛⌛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10">00:10</a> 为啥我要给小妍妍按头安利《再见爱人4》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="156">02:36</a> 其实迷糊的是李行亮！</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;水星双鱼四分海王星射手及梦幻婚礼的思想源头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="249">04:09</a> 为什么说逃避的主角是李行亮？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;他在感情中各种表现的根本原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="675">11:15</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;为什么说麦琳比李行亮理智？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;她拥有福尔摩斯的直觉</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;观众看到她的“作”是哪儿来的？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;水星火星巨蟹梅花土星射手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1021">17:01</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;从星盘解读为什么麦琳更靠谱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1088">18:08</a> &nbsp;李行亮&amp;麦琳合盘浅读</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2143">35:43</a> &nbsp;正确解读婚姻模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2265">37:45</a> &nbsp;离婚不是解决问题的唯一或最佳途径</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2324">38:44</a> &nbsp;从合盘找出他们可以不离婚又能很幸福的能量所在</span></p><span></span><p><span>🙋‍♀️在哪里还可以看到主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：妍言盐颜</span></p><span></span><p><span>想进星友群的朋友可加微信：fairyhome_yan（备注星友进群）</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>占星基础班正在招生中，感兴趣的听友可通过以上方式联系我们</span></strong></em></p>]]></description>
